.TH "REDACTION_FIXTURE" "1" "2026-11-16" "" ""
.SH NAME
redaction_fixture \- Redaction fixture command tree.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B redaction_fixture
Usage: redaction_fixture [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Redaction fixture command tree.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-region\fR \fISTRING\fR, \fB\-r\fR \fISTRING\fR
Region identifier served by the fixture.
.br
Default: \fBString :: from("eu-west")\fR
.TP
\fB\-\-mode\fR \fICHOICE\fR, \fB\-m\fR \fICHOICE\fR
Public mode advertised by the fixture.
.br
Default: \fBString :: from("fast")\fR
.br
Possible values: \fIfast, safe\fR
.TP
\fB\-\-token\fR \fICHOICE\fR, \fB\-t\fR \fICHOICE\fR
Confidential token used by the fixture service.
.TP
\fB\-\-locator\fR \fICHOICE\fR, \fB\-l\fR \fICHOICE\fR
Locator the application resolves elsewhere.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fBREDACTION_FIXTURE_API_KEY\fR
Confidential API key. Equivalent to \fB\--api-key\fR.
.TP
\fBREDACTION_FIXTURE_CREDENTIAL_FILE\fR
Credential file reference.
.TP
\fBREDACTION_FIXTURE_LOCATOR\fR
Locator resolved elsewhere. Equivalent to \fB\--locator\fR.
.TP
\fBREDACTION_FIXTURE_MODE\fR
Public mode. Equivalent to \fB\--mode\fR.
.TP
\fBREDACTION_FIXTURE_REGION\fR
Region identifier. Equivalent to \fB\--region\fR.
.TP
\fBREDACTION_FIXTURE_TOKEN\fR
Confidential token. Equivalent to \fB\--token\fR.
.SH FILES
.PP
Configuration keys:
.TP
\fBregion\fR
Region identifier.
.TP
\fBmode\fR
Public mode.
.TP
\fBtoken\fR
Confidential token.
.TP
\fBlocator\fR
Locator resolved elsewhere.
.TP
\fBapi_key\fR
Confidential API key.
.TP
\fBcredential_file\fR
Credential file reference.
.SH PRECEDENCE
Configuration values are resolved in the following order (highest precedence last):
.RS
.IP 1. 4
Built-in defaults
.IP 2. 4
Configuration files
.IP 3. 4
Profile overlays
.IP 4. 4
Environment variables
.IP 5. 4
Command-line arguments
.RE
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
\fB0\fR
Successful execution.
.TP
\fB1\fR
General errors.
.SH COMMANDS
.SS rotate
Rotates the confidential token.
.PP
OPTIONS:
.TP
\fB\-\-replacement\fR \fICHOICE\fR, \fB\-r\fR \fICHOICE\fR
Confidential replacement token.
.TP
\fB\-\-is-dry-run\fR\fI[=BOOL]\fR, \fB\-i\fR\fI[=BOOL]\fR
Reports the rotation without applying it.
.SS status
Reports fixture status.
.PP
OPTIONS:
.TP
\fB\-\-detail-level\fR \fISTRING\fR, \fB\-d\fR \fISTRING\fR
Detail level reported by the status command.
